Dialogue: 4,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.10,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,180)\pos(540,270)}The Tiny Idea
Dialogue: 4,0:00:00.25,0:00:03.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,160)}Milo had a big problem.

Dialogue: 4,0:00:03.10,0:00:06.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,160)}Every morning felt too heavy.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:06.80,0:00:10.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,160)}Then one tiny idea showed up.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:10.50,0:00:14.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,160)}"Just start with one small step."
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.30,0:00:18.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,160)}So Milo tried it.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.20,0:00:22.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,160)}The problem did not vanish...
Dialogue: 4,0:00:20.40,0:00:22.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,140)\pos(540,300)}but Milo moved.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.60,0:00:27.00,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,220)}What is your tiny step today?

